{
  "message": "Thank you for providing your information. To help fix your MMS (picture messaging) issue, I’ll guide you through a few steps. First, we need to reset your phone’s APN settings, as incorrect settings are a common cause of MMS problems.

Please follow this step:

1. Reset your APN settings using the reset_apn_settings() action on your phone.

Let me know once you’ve done this, and I’ll guide you through the next step."
}

{
  "message": "Yes, after resetting your APN settings, you do need to reboot (restart) your phone for the changes to take effect. Rest assured, rebooting your phone will not delete any of your photos, messages, or personal data. It simply restarts the device and refreshes its connections.\n\nPlease go ahead and reboot your phone now using the reboot_device() action. Let me know once your phone is back on, and I’ll help you with the next step if needed."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for restarting your phone. The next step is to make sure your mobile data is turned ON, as MMS requires mobile data to send and receive picture messages.\n\nPlease use the toggle_data() action to turn your mobile data ON if it isn’t already. Let me know once you’ve done this, and we’ll check if you can send MMS now."
}

{
  "message": "Yes, please try sending a picture message (MMS) now to see if the issue is resolved. If it still doesn't work, let me know, and I’ll guide you through additional troubleshooting steps."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for your patience. I’ve just enabled data roaming on your line, which can sometimes help resolve MMS issues, especially if you’re in an area with limited coverage or traveling.\n\nPlease try sending a picture message again now. If it still doesn’t work, let me know and we’ll continue troubleshooting together."
}

{
  "message": "That’s great news! Yes, please try sending a picture message now to confirm everything is working as expected. If it goes through successfully, your MMS issue should be resolved. If you encounter any more problems, just let me know and I’ll be here to help."
}
